  "summary": "postinstall scrapes cloud credential env vars and executes local commands",
  "details": "On `npm install`, the package's postinstall hook enumerates the installer's environment for AWS/GCP/GOOGLE-prefixed variables and pipes matches to a netcat sink (`env | grep 'AWS\\|GCP\\|GOOGLE' | nc...`), and separately spawns `open /System/Applications/Calculator.app` as a proof-of-execution marker. Neither behavior relates to the package's stated purpose of setting a DOM background color. The package's own `description` field states it contains malware for demo purposes.",
